{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And it was.</b> Some say that the raising of his hand was like one who holds a banner in battle. But if so, Aaron or Hur could have raised it, or they could have stood him in a high place on the mountain so that he would be seen standing. The correct view is what our predecessors said:"], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 17, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:19.444358101Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}